  "module_docs": [
    "Port of",
    "`net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.SetTransientBlockPacket`.",
    "",
    "# Deferrals",
    "",
    "Java's `Block` field is written with `Block.STATE_NETWORK_TYPE`, which is",
    "`VAR_INT.transform(Block::fromStateId, Block::stateId)` \u2014 the block's",
    "protocol state id and nothing else. The port therefore carries that id",
    "directly rather than a `Block`: it is exactly the wire payload, and it keeps",
    "this packet free of the `instance` module. A caller holding a",
    "`instance::block::block::Block` passes `block.state_id()`; a caller reading",
    "the packet resolves it back with `instance::block::block::from_state_id`."
  ],
